{%- comment -%}
  Art Avenue - single-size products.

  This snippet used to blank the size hint on products offering only one size,
  on the reasoning that a hint pointing at an absent choice was noise.

  Reversed 2026-08-22. On a single-size product the hint is the ONLY place the
  size name appears, and an empty slot reads as a rendering fault when sitting
  beside multi-size PDPs that show "Compact", "Grand", "Queen" and so on.
  Leaving the hint untouched lets the engine's own value ("One Size") display
  in the same position, so every PDP is visually consistent.

  Kept as a no-op rather than removed: existing render call sites stay valid,
  and file deletion is unavailable through the Admin API. Delete this file and
  its render call sites together via git when convenient.
{%- endcomment -%}
